{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测非常见UA访问Azure WireServer。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Azure WireServer HTTP Request from Unexpected User Agent。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.http*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】非常见UA访问Azure WireServer","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n非常见UA访问Azure WireServer\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://cybercx.com.au/blog/azure-ssrf-metadata/","https://www.netspi.com/blog/technical-blog/cloud-pentesting/decrypting-vm-extension-settings-with-azure-wireserver/","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/escalating-privileges-azure-kubernetes-services","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/what-is-ip-address-168-63-129-16"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"359b5925-a625-4803-90d2-19e44a37d98e","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"network where event.module == \"network_traffic\" and\ndestination.ip == \"168.63.129.16\" and\nuser_agent.original != null and\nnot user_agent.original : (\n  \"WALinuxAgent*\",\n  \"VMAgent*\",\n  \"Python-urllib*\",\n  \"cpprestsdk*\",\n  \"ACMS/*\"\n) and\n(\n  url.query : (\"*comp=versions*\", \"*comp=goalstate*\", \"*comp=certificates*\") or\n  (destination.port == 32526 and url.path : (\"/versions\", \"/vmSettings\"))\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1552.005","name":"Cloud Instance Metadata API","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006",